        "date": "2026-10-25T17:54:55Z"
      },
      "message": "T13: clinical tools (eGFR CKD-EPI 2021, BMI, drug class)\n\nsrc/trialguide/tools/: values a model should compute or look up, not guess.\n- egfr_ckd_epi_2021: race-free CKD-EPI 2021 (adults only); ckd_epi_2009 kept\n  as a reference because the Eka set grades eGFR with it\n- bmi: metric and imperial units\n- drug_class_atc: NLM RxClass ATC classes, brand names resolved, combination\n  products dropped, lookups cached on disk\nA missing or invalid input gives a missing result with the reason, never a\nguess; a computed result cites its inputs and formula. TOOLS holds JSON\nschemas for LLM tool calling; call_tool never raises.\n\nChecks: 25 unit tests (hand-derived values, incl. the proposal's examples;\ndrug class replays recorded RxClass responses offline) and 15/15 Eka\ncalculator items (12 BMI, 3 eGFR via the 2009 reference).",
